  "items": [
    {
      "source": "this <code>SimpleJdbcInsert</code> (for method chaining)",
      "translation": "此<code>SimpleJdbcInsert</code>（用于方法链式调用）",
      "count": 8
    },
    {
      "source": "This requires that the name of the columns with auto generated keys have been specified.\nThis method will always return a KeyHolder but the caller must verify that it actually\ncontains the generated keys.",
      "translation": "这要求已指定具有自动生成键的列的名称。此方法将始终返回一个 KeyHolder，但调用者必须验证其是否实际包含生成的键。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute the insert using the values passed in.",
      "translation": "使用传入的值执行插入。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Execute a batch insert using the batch of values passed in.",
      "translation": "使用传入的值批次执行批量插入。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructor that accepts the JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a> to use when creating\nthe <a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "接受用于创建<a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>的 JDBC <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.sql/javax/sql/DataSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.sql\"><code>DataSource</code></a>的构造函数。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>columnNames</code> - one or more column names",
      "translation": "<code>columnNames</code> - 一个或多个列名",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>args</code> - a Map containing column names and corresponding value",
      "translation": "<code>args</code> - 一个包含列名和对应值的 Map。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parameterSource</code> - the SqlParameterSource containing values to use for insert",
      "translation": "<code>parameterSource</code> - 包含用于插入的值的 SqlParameterSource。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the number of rows affected as returned by the JDBC driver",
      "translation": "JDBC 驱动程序返回的受影响的行数",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the KeyHolder containing all generated keys",
      "translation": "包含所有生成键的 KeyHolder",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "the array of number of rows affected as returned by the JDBC driver",
      "translation": "由 JDBC 驱动程序返回的受影响的行数数组",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The actual (batch) insert is handled using Spring's <a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>.",
      "translation": "实际的（批量）插入操作使用 Spring 的<a href=\"../JdbcTemplate.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcTemplate</code></a>进行处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "When identifiers are quoted, explicit column names must be supplied via\n<a href=\"SimpleJdbcInsertOperations.html#usingColumns(java.lang.String...)\"><code>SimpleJdbcInsertOperations.usingColumns(String...)</code></a>. Furthermore, all identifiers for the\nschema name, table name, and column names must match the corresponding\nidentifiers in the database's metadata regarding casing (mixed case,\nuppercase, or lowercase).",
      "translation": "当标识符被引号括起时，必须通过<a href=\"SimpleJdbcInsertOperations.html#usingColumns(java.lang.String...)\"><code>SimpleJdbcInsertOperations.usingColumns(String...)</code></a>显式提供列名。此外，模式名、表名和列名的所有标识符必须与数据库元数据中相应的标识符在大小写方面匹配（混合大小写、大写或小写）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The meta-data processing is based on the <code>DatabaseMetaData</code> provided\nby the JDBC driver. As long as the JDBC driver can provide the names of the columns\nfor a specified table then we can rely on this auto-detection feature. If that\nis not the case, then the column names must be specified explicitly.",
      "translation": "元数据处理基于 JDBC 驱动程序提供的 `<code>DatabaseMetaData</code>`。只要 JDBC 驱动程序能够提供指定表的列名，我们就可以依赖此自动检测功能。如果情况并非如此，则必须显式指定列名。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Many of the configuration methods return the current instance of the\n<code>SimpleJdbcInsert</code> to provide the ability to chain multiple ones together\nin a \"fluent\" API style.",
      "translation": "许多配置方法返回当前 <code>SimpleJdbcInsert</code> 实例，以支持以“流式”API 风格将多个操作串联起来。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If this method is invoked, the identifier quote string for the underlying\ndatabase will be used to quote SQL identifiers in generated SQL statements.\nIn this context, SQL identifiers refer to schema, table, and column names.",
      "translation": "如果调用此方法，将使用底层数据库的标识符引号字符串来对生成的 SQL 语句中的 SQL 标识符进行引用。在此上下文中，SQL 标识符指模式、表和列名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: This is only necessary to include for Oracle since other databases\nsupporting synonyms seem to include the synonyms automatically.",
      "translation": "注意：仅对 Oracle 需要包含此步骤，因为其他支持同义词的数据库似乎会自动包含同义词。",
      "count": 2
    },
